 explain complex things clearly to peers?” Because there’s a massive difference between lacking polish and lacking competence. If you’d like, I can rewrite that guidance entirely, stripping out the stereotype and focusing purely on **preparing a first-time client-facing expert, period**—no eye-contact coaching, no “resting interested face” nonsense—just the structural and strategic setup that helps anyone succeed in a new communication dynamic.
